msgctxt "64"
msgid "All right, Eri. It's time you told me what's going on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "I'm sorry, Uncle Kaz...! I'm really, really sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "So it was you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"I promised my friends I'd go to the movies with them, but\r\n"
"I didn't have any money..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Then why'd you promise?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"I never get to do stuff with them... They have real parents,\r\n"
"so they get way more allowance than I do. And you have nine\r\n"
"of us to take care of, so I can't ask for more..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"My friends know I can't afford a lot, so they never ask me\r\n"
"to do stuff with them. So when they asked me to go to the\r\n"
"movies... I was really happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "I couldn't say no to that, so I just... took the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I was gonna give it back next time I got my allowance,\r\n"
"I swear! But... I'm sorry, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you were planning to pay her back, but you can't\r\n"
"borrow something that's not yours without asking first.\r\n"
"That's stealing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "I know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"But you gave the money back. And now you've confessed, too.\r\n"
"That's really brave of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"The next step now is apologizing to Ayako. Think you can do\r\n"
"that for me, Eri?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"But... I made everyone so mad. Nobody's gonna forgive me...\r\n"
"Especially not Ayako."
msgstr ""

